> References

- [Sohn (2016), Improved Deep Metric Learning with Multi-class N-pair Loss Objective](https://papers.neurips.cc/paper/2016/hash/6b180037abbebea991d8b1232f8a8ca9-Abstract.html).
- [Song et al. (2016), Deep Metric Learning via Lifted Structured Feature Embedding](https://arxiv.org/abs/1511.06452).
